    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential are delighted to present this beautifully maintained three-bedroom end of terrace home offering stylish and contemporary living.\r\n\r\nAs you enter this impressive home, you are greeted by a spacious entrance hall that leads to a bright and inviting living room perfect for relaxing or entertaining. The modern kitchen and dining area, upgraded by the current owner, is located to the rear and offers direct access to the spacious rear garden, ideal for outdoor dining and family activities. Upstairs, the property features three well-proportioned bedrooms (including primary with an en suite) along with a contemporary main bathroom.\r\n\r\nCastleview is ideally located within walking distance of local shops, schools and commuter bus links including the Swords Express making the City Centre & Dublin Airport within easy reach. Swords Village and the Pavilions Shopping Centre are also within close proximity with a host of amenities including restaurants, shops, cafes and cinema.\r\n\r\nThis well-presented home combines comfort, convenience, and a family-friendly setting, making it an ideal choice for a wide range of buyers. \r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended to appreciate this fine home.\r\n\r\n***Disclaimer:*** *All details are provided to the best of our knowledge. While we strive for accuracy, some information may have been provided by the vendor. We are not liable for any mistakes, errors, or inaccuracies in our online advertising, and we advise all interested parties to seek professional advice regarding any concerns.*"
      },
